use.body:
Please do not:
- overload the site or try to disrupt it or its security;
- collect large parts of the data by automated means. Use the public calendar feeds instead;
- submit false, abusive or unlawful reports.

takedown.body:
If you own rights to material shown on the site (for example a cover image, a trademark or text) and want it removed:
- open the page of the game, platform or event that shows it;
- use its "Report a problem" link and choose the report type "Takedown or copyright request";
- say what should be removed, where it appears and why, and how you are connected to the rights.
Takedown requests are never shown publicly and are sent to the site owner only. We honor takedown requests: after receiving one we remove the material concerned and record the outcome.
